  - logo mark;
  - wordmark;
  - palette, with light and dark;
  - type pairing;
  - one-line positioning;
  - a sample: README banner, app icon at 16/32/256 px, and one GUI screen fragment.
- Put them in docs/brand/concepts/<a|b|c>/ as SVG and PNG, with a one-page board PNG per direction at 1920x1080.
- The board for each direction also shows: the CLI's terminal colours on a dark and a light terminal, how it sits beside the PonsOS brand (<path> docs/brand/, BRANDING.md, tokens) as a sibling product, and the 16 px icon legible in a Windows taskbar and an IceWM menu.
